<title>USA: Wedding Information FY96 June 30 net rises.</title>
<headline>Wedding Information FY96 June 30 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>OMAHA, Neb. 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>YEAR ENDED JUNE 30</p>
<p>						    1996		1995</p>
<p> REVENUES				 $5,108,294	  3,880,725</p>
<p>SELLING, MARKETING</p>
<p>  PRODUCTION COSTS		     3,839,890	  2,658,755</p>
<p> TOTAL COSTS &amp; EXPENSES		5,021,195	  3,834,140</p>
<p> OPERATING INCOME			   87,099	     46,585</p>
<p> INTEREST INCOME			    31,038	     20,522</p>
<p>INCOME FROM CONTINUING</p>
<p>  OPERATIONS				 118,137	     67,107</p>
<p>INCOME FROM DISCONTINUED</p>
<p>  OPERATIONS				  13,580	     35,223</p>
<p> NET INCOME				  131,717	    102,330</p>
<p>NET INCOME PER COMMON</p>
<p>AND COMMON EQUIVALENT</p>
<p>  SHARE					    .04		  .03</p>
<p>WEIGHTED AVERAGE SHARES</p>
<p>  OUTSTANDING			    3,320,423	  3,334,970</p>
<p>NOTE: Full company name is Wedding Information Network Inc.</p>
<p>--Reuters Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787</p>
